## What the example checks

| Scenario | Expected result |
| --- | --- |
| Order two available portions | Submit one request and show the returned order ID. |
| Invalid quantity or unavailable item | Reject the order before calling the gateway. |
| Gateway fails or returns an empty order ID | Keep the order unconfirmed. |
| A second submission arrives while the first is pending | Call the gateway once. |
| React Native Redux state changes | Verify the real store, reducer, and thunk behavior. |

The sample item costs 1250 minor units. Two portions have a local quoted total of 2500 minor units, displayed as 25.00 in this fixture. Confirm the real product's currency, availability, and server pricing rules before adapting the sample.

